Bosch Power Tools operates an extensive factory-authorized service network providing standardized maintenance and repair services through trained technicians using genuine components. The MaxVantagePRO (MVP) repair program provides extended 1-year warranties (4x longer than standard), comprehensive component inspection, and cleaning. Tools beyond economic repair receive replacement discount coupons, incentivizing retained customer relationships. The E-Repair network modernizes service accessibility through online platforms. This standardized service infrastructure combined with parts availability ensures consistent maintenance quality across markets, extending product lifespan while generating service revenue and maintaining brand loyalty through post-purchase engagement.